      <DropProbability>0.5</DropProbability>
      <Health>18</Health>
      <Description>Platinum-lined containment with superconducting coils and onboard quartet sensing.

COMPATIBILITY
Aether, Helion and Empyrean.
1x Standard lifetime and crafting cost.

INSTALLATION
Use same-grade quartets; the shell holds 80 tiles.
Normal shutdown retains tiles; venting discards them.</Description>
